. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KHsa_IQphcMQ7kNvwH0XNxJ&_nc_oc=Adrf3Dq0YdrGGipfnKqcmbDPTDMPH0fL57RCFHNfghL_VwqBCWzaus-TWzkyqDlmAZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA5ZWTT61plwglilfX-TMdgLYxPds3Je3BF3C2LJBmwgg&oe=6A66053E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9n8vmbuy89QQ7kNvwFgL_E9&_nc_oc=AdrVQysAtxXbzVnvv8wvngmucfQOZrnxLK_Xpqzw7ePvjxzan17ab93elYY89m80P-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBDPqD4OJ--6u2tRScSAy2f2qeQ63AtVEyE4Fp8rab-gQ&oe=6A661BDE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ukfVzCciMEIQ7kNvwEfVXRM&_nc_oc=AdrvKjsmJLsyldVsidJpx5b7jsy7SUhaKN4umCx8fIC8IWZ7X1hQO3xSk1mzb2_jB38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBJR4U0dniovVNZcQ1kuZ7l-agP3lzof2u7sJoV-Frzjw&oe=6A66115B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco